+# Large session save implementation plan
+
+Goal: Save large restored conversations without a whole-payload JSON.stringify call, preserving existing session round trips and atomic persistence.
+
+Approach: Generate bounded JSON fragments, including long strings and the quoted plaintext envelope. Feed fragments directly to the existing async and synchronous atomic writers. Preserve the legacy encrypted envelope for one-fragment payloads; for larger payloads encrypt each bounded fragment and store ciphertexts in the envelope's data array. Update manager, read-only recovery, repair, and quarantine paths to recognize encrypted arrays.
+
+Risks: JSON omission/toJSON semantics, surrogate pairs at fragment boundaries, generator failures leaving staging files, stale writes, synchronous shutdown durability, and consistent encrypted-array support across readers. Whole-file reads remain outside this save-path change; reading files above V8's string limit still requires a separate streaming-reader change.
+
+- [x] Reproduce the whole-payload stringify in the real session save path with a deterministic allocation-size guard. Old implementation fails the 19k-message test because the rejected serialization leaves no saved file.
+- [x] Add bounded serialization and wire both atomic writers, preserving fsync, rename, epoch checks, and cleanup. Capture fragments synchronously so updates during async I/O cannot alter an in-flight save.
+- [x] Verify normal/encrypted round trips, 19k-message save, long strings, JSON semantics, and interrupted writes. Focused existing suites: 101 tests pass; expanded new suites: 11 tests pass. Standalone compiled-runtime stress: 623,188,946 bytes across 10,858 fragments, above V8 MAX_STRING_LENGTH 536,870,888; async and synchronous atomic writers both pass and clean up their output. Evidence: `_scratch/large-save-stress.log` and `_scratch/large-session-save-stress.cjs`.
+- [x] Run targeted tests and canonical project gates; record any environment failures. Final focused six-file suite: 129 tests pass; final additional three-file suite: 19 tests pass. TypeScript application/spec checks, lint, LOC ratchet, main build and renderer build pass. Full suite exits 1: 29,981 passed, 3 failed, 7 skipped across 2,382 files (2 failed / 2,380 passed), 746.05 seconds. The only failures are unrelated environment problems: supplied linked node_modules owner manifests differ, and the Homebrew Node used by both SEA repeatability tests lacks the SEA fuse. The full run started before the last encryption/quarantine follow-up; focused and independent checks cover the final patch. Do not change the shared dependency install or unrelated build tooling for this task.
+- [ ] Obtain a clean independent fresh-agent task-completion-gate PASS. First pass found whole-plaintext encryption allocation, now fixed. A different fresh verifier independently passed 107 focused tests, adjacent snapshot tests, 300 deterministic native-JSON/Unicode parity cases, both compiled writers on 830,813,601 encrypted bytes in 13,572 bounded fragments, TypeScript and lint. Final independent verdict: FAIL solely on Gate 0's environment blocker; no critical patch issues, warnings, actionable suggestions, or source remediation requested. The literal full-suite gate remains blocked by the supplied environment.
+
+Status: Implementation and focused verification applied; active pending a clean full-suite completion gate. Encrypted writes now use bounded plaintext/ciphertext fragments, and all associated readers, repair and quarantine accept them. Existing small encrypted and plaintext formats round-trip exactly. Full-suite environment failures prevent closing this plan under the required workflow. No branch, worktree, commit, or external application changes.
+
+Evidence: `_scratch/large-save-focused-final.log`, `_scratch/large-save-final-regression.log`, `_scratch/large-save-spec-typecheck-final.log`, `_scratch/large-save-typecheck.log`, `_scratch/large-save-lint.log`, `_scratch/large-save-loc.log`, `_scratch/large-save-build-main.log`, `_scratch/large-save-build-renderer.log`, `_scratch/large-save-stress-encrypted.log`, `_scratch/large-save-fresh-final-focused.log`, `_scratch/large-save-fresh-final-baseline.log`, `_scratch/large-save-full-test.log`.
